{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01948","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 垂柳覆金堤 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 垂柳覆金堤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新年垂柳色，嫋嫋对空闺。\n不畏芳菲好，自缘离别嗁。\n因风飘玉户，向日映金堤。\n驿使何时度？还将赠陇西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}